# Outfit body (R18): a cropped, puffy bomber jacket: a thick top-heavy body ending above the hips on a gathered
# (inset) accent waistband, puffed shoulders standing out past the torso, a big accent collar, steel zip, a glowing
# sleeve patch. Shorter and wider at the top than the hoodie.
# Torso inside x 2..9, y 2..10 (pivot 5 6 0 on spine_03).
